revision.text:
Most '''ingredients''' available in the game are unlocked through normal progression and can be purchased from the shop with [[Currency|Pizza Funds]], while others are only available during certain [[event]]s and bought with unique event currency.
== Ingredients == === Chapter === Chapter ingredients are unlocked as you progress through each [[:Category:Chapters|chapter]] in the main story.
