== Autobuddies == {{Main|Upgrades}}
All ingredients except for Doughs have a corresponding Autobuddy [[upgrade]]. Autobuddies add an ingredient to half of a pizza with a single tap/click, placing them evenly spaced on the Dough and decreasing preparation time, which helps to increase tips from customers.
== Custom topping arrangement == A new feature to be able to customize the contents of your topping bins was introduced in version 5.18.0. This feature is accessed via the '''Kitchen''' button on [[Home]]. Here you can place your toppings in an order that best suits your needs.
There are a few limitations to this feature: * You cannot change the location of the actual bins, only their contents. * Dough and Wheat Dough placement cannot be changed. * Tomato Sauce and Pesto Sauce can only be swapped between the two designated sauce bins. * All toppings must be equipped to save your changes. A feature to hide Pizza pass toppings was introduced in version 5.34.0.<gallery spacing="small"> Topping Tutorial 01-Topping Categories.png|Topping Categories (01/07) Topping Tutorial 02-Remove Topping.png|Remove Topping (02/07) Topping Tutorial 03-Topping Placement.png|Topping Placement (03/07) Topping Tutorial 04-Dragging.png|Dragging (04/07) Topping Tutorial 05-Topping Removal.png|Topping Removal (05/07) Topping Tutorial 06-Unplaced Toppings.png|Unplaced Toppings (06/07) Topping Tutorial 07-Save Layout.png|Save Layout (07/07) </gallery>
== Cost and profit == {{Main|Ingredients/Cost and profit}}
Each ingredient costs a set amount of [[Currency|Pizza Funds]] to use and is charged to you immediately during the pizza-making process. Utilizing the counter Plant Pot and, later in [[Chapter 4]], the [[Garden]] will help keep ingredient costs down and profit up.*
<nowiki>*</nowiki>In the Apple Arcade version, the garden and Plant Pot are unlocked in Chapter 1.
== Related achievements == {{Related achievements}}
== Trivia == *The only time you get to use the [[Grand Pi]] toppings outside of the event is in [[Dr. Michael Keh]]'s kitchen in [[Chapter 5]]. *The toppings from Chapter 5 - Figs, Zucchini, and Artichoke - are currently the only toppings from the main game (not from events) that can only be obtained by [[garden]]ing.
