== Trivia == *One of the orders for this topping references a lyric to ''Under the Sea'', a song in the Disney movie ''[[Wikipedia:The Little Mermaid (1989 film)|The Little Mermaid]]''. When you ask "What?" in response to the order, the customer will reply that they have a little mermaid at home. *There are two orders that are references to the Nickelodeon animated TV show ''[[Wikipedia:SpongeBob SquarePants|SpongeBob SquarePants]]'': **One order is a reference to a quote said by Mr. Krabs in the very first episode (''Help Wanted''). Asking "What?" and the customer will reply with "ANCHOVIES!!!".<ref>[https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0707293/characters/nm0000317 Mr. Krabs' quotes in ''SpongeBob SquarePants''] at IMDb</ref> **Another order is a reference to the first lyric to the show's theme song.
