{{Ingredient | title = Corn | image = <gallery> Ingredients Corn.png|Default Ingredients Skins Corn Blossom.png|Skin 1 Ingredients Skins Wheat Corn.png|Skin 2 Ingredients Skins Corn Crown.png|Skin 3 Ingredients Skins Moon Corn.png|Skin 4 Ingredients Skins Flourishing Corn.png|Skin 5 Ingredients Corn-Box.png|Box Recipe Corn.png|Recipe </gallery> | name = Corn | type = Vegetable | unlocked = [[Chapter 3]] | cost_to_unlock = {{$|150}} | value = {{$|1.00}}/pizza | cost = {{$|0.72}}/pizza | previous = [[Shrimp]] | next = [[Chicken]] }} '''Corn''' is a [[:Category:Vegetables|vegetable]] [[Ingredients|ingredient]] unlocked in [[Chapter 3]]. It is the thirteenth topping available in the game and the second topping unlocked in Chapter 3. Corn is also classified as a grain along with [[Wheat Dough]].
== Acquisition == Corn, along with [[Chicken]], becomes available one in-game day after you complete the [[Jack O'Lanter|Farmer]]'s [[List of orders#Farmer|order]] on Day 81 (or Day 10 of [[Chapter 3]]).
== Upgrade == The '''Corn Autobuddy''' can be purchased in the [[Upgrades]] section of the shop. The pricing for the upgrades are: * Mobile: {{$|40|PG}} * Steam: {{$|500}}
