{{Ingredient | title = Shrimp | image = <gallery> Ingredients Shrimp.png|Default Ingredients Skins Embracing Shrimp.png|Skin 1 Ingredients Skins KittyShrimp.png|Skin 2 Ingredients Skins Candy Shrimp.png|Skin 3 Ingredients Skins Beach Shrimp.png|Skin 4 Ingredients Skins Scaredy Cat Shrimp.png|Skin 5 Ingredients Shrimp-Box.png|Box Recipe Shrimp.png|Recipe </gallery> | name = Shrimp | other_names = *Prawns *''Gamberi'' *Fruit of the sea | type = Meat | type2 = Seafood | unlocked = [[Chapter 3]] | cost_to_unlock = {{$|150}} | value = {{$|3.60}}/pizza | cost = {{$|3.24}}/pizza | previous = [[Basil]] | next = [[Corn]] }} '''Shrimp''' is an [[Ingredients|ingredient]] unlocked in Chapter 3. Customers may refer to shrimp in their orders as "the fruit of the sea," "prawns," or ''gamberi'', which is Italian for shrimp. Shrimp is a meat and seafood topping.
== Acquisition == Shrimp is unlocked on day 78 (or 7th day of [[Chapter 3]]), a day after completing the [[Steve|Surfer]]'s [[List of orders#Surfer Dude|order]].
== Upgrade == The '''Shrimp Autobuddy''' can be purchased in the [[Upgrades]] section of the shop. The pricing for the upgrades are: * Mobile: {{$|40|PG}} * Steam: {{$|500}}
