{{Ingredient | title = Zucchini | image = <gallery> Ingredients Zucchini.png|Default Ingredients Skins Zucchini Hat.png|Skin 1 Ingredients Skins Slime Zucchini.png|Skin 2 Ingredients Zucchini-Box.png|Box Recipe Zucchini.png|Recipe </gallery> | name = Zucchini | type = Fruit | type2 = Green | unlocked = [[Chapter 5]] | cost_to_unlock = Free | value = {{$|3.90}}/pizza | cost = Free (via [[garden]]ing) | previous = [[Fig]] | next = [[Artichoke]] }} '''Zucchini''' is the next [[:Category:Fruits|fruit]] [[Ingredients|ingredient]] unlocked in [[Chapter 5]], after [[Fig]]s. It is the twenty-fifth topping in the game.
== Acquisition == Zucchini first becomes available when [[Alicante]] gives you 10 Zucchini seeds in return for a pizza he requests. You can plant the seeds, despite them not being available in the shop yet. The next day, the topping becomes unlocked after [[Octavia Bell]] realizes that she accidentally gave Alicante Zucchini seeds instead of Fig seeds. At that point forward, you now obtain a Zucchini License and can buy the seeds in the seed shop.
== Upgrade == The '''Zucchini Autobuddy''' can be purchased in the [[Upgrades]] section of the shop. The pricing for the upgrades are: * Mobile: {{$|40|PG}} * Steam: {{$|500}}
