{{Ingredient | title = Artichoke | image = <gallery> Ingredients Artichoke.png|Single Ingredients Skins Gingko Artichoke.png|Skin 1 Ingredients Skins Butterfly Artichoke.png|Skin 2 Ingredients Skins Celestial Artichoke.png|Skin 3 Ingredients Skins Budding Artichoke.png|Skin 4 Ingredients Skins Yarn Artichoke.png|Skin 5 Ingredients Artichoke-Box.png|Box Recipe Artichoke.png|Recipe </gallery> | name = Artichoke | other_names = Artichoke heart | type = Vegetable | unlocked = [[Chapter 5]] | cost_to_unlock = Free | value = {{$|5}}/pizza | cost = Free (via [[garden]]ing) | previous = [[Zucchini]] | next = [[Pumpkin]] }} '''Artichoke''', also referred by customers as '''Artichoke Heart''', is the first and only [[:Category:Vegetables|vegetable]] [[Ingredients|ingredient]] unlocked in [[Chapter 5]]. It is the twenty-sixth topping in the game.
== Acquisition == Artichoke becomes available when [[Cicero Burrata]] comes to your pizzeria the day after you show her a magazine article in her pizzeria, where Cicero gives you 10 Artichoke seeds in return. The topping is then unlocked, and its seeds become available in the seeds shop. You also obtain an Artichoke License so you can keep planting it permanently.
== Upgrade == The '''Artichoke Autobuddy''' can be purchased in the [[Upgrades]] section of the shop. The pricing for the upgrades are: * Mobile: {{$|40|PG}} * Steam: {{$|500}}
