{{About|the recipes listed in the Recipe Book located in the game menu|a full list of customer orders|List of orders}}
The '''Recipe Book''' is a collection of basic recipes that unlock as you discover new recipes in the game. Pizzas that are made via the [[ZaZoom app]] on the [[MyPad]] also count towards unlocking new recipes.
As additional [[ingredients]] are made available in the game, any recipes that do not have a fixed set of ingredients (i.e., "variable" recipes) will update automatically to include the new toppings. If you have purchased Topping Skins, the recipe images will reflect whichever custom skins you have currently selected in your game. __TOC__
